<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers:  Mostly Choice 2-4 1250-1300 lbs few 69.50-69.75</p>
<p>Heifers: Mostly Choice 2-4 1200 lbs ld	 69.75</p>
<p>Carcass basis - Steers and heifers not well established.</p>
<p>Steers:  mostly Choice 2-4  1250-1300 lbs few    111.00</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 110.00 Reported sales for Tuesday: 400  Week to Date: 1,700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
